--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SCOPE, AND WHY IT IS WRITTEN THIS WAY
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This licence covers the files in THIS REPOSITORY: kitsune.manifest.json, the
build scripts, the stylesheets, the branding and the documentation. None of them
contains Mozilla code.

Kitsune is an overlay. It ships no Firefox source and modifies none. If Firefox
source is ever vendored here, those files carry the Mozilla Public License 2.0,
file-level copyleft, and keep their per-file headers. Nothing in this repository
may be relicensed in a way that conflicts with that, and no file derived from
Firefox may be moved under this licence.

"Firefox" and the Firefox logos are trademarks of the Mozilla Foundation and are
not licensed to this project. See docs/CREDITS.md for the trademark position and
for the fact that Kitsune is not sponsored by, endorsed by, or affiliated with
Mozilla or the Firefox project.
